// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
//
// Copy to Developer.local.xcconfig, which Git ignores, and name the developer's
// handles. Only an AppStore build made with this file has the rows they turn
// on; every other build carries none of them and no handle. Store a handle,
// never a whole address: `//` starts a comment in an xcconfig, and the code
// builds the address.
//
// DEVELOPER_X_HANDLE turns on Follow developer on X, an Info row that opens the
// developer's profile on X. The row also needs the logo in the ignored Local
// directory beside this file: Local/x-logo.svg, a single-colour vector (one
// path, any fill) that the row draws as a template image. A build made with the
// handle and without the logo fails.

DEVELOPER_X_HANDLE = example_handle
